  ('6a648342-15df-412e-2b73-e075ae239bee', '9e4d4107-041f-3db8-1781-bed4219b6401', 'mulberry', 'Mulberry', 'Sweet and juicy mulberries, perfect for snacking or adding to desserts and cereals.', NULL, 'ACTIVE'),
